#: src/main.ui:135
msgid ""
"Only one face model is enrolled. Lighting changes how your face looks to the "
"camera, so a single model can fail in the evening under lamps (or in "
"daylight). Add a second model recorded in different light to keep unlocking "
"reliable at any time of day."
msgstr ""
"Awoṣe oju kan ṣoṣo ni o forukọsilẹ. Imọlẹ yipada bi oju rẹ ṣe n wo kamẹra, "
"nitorinaa awoṣe kan le kuna ni irọlẹ labẹ awọn atupa (tabi ni oju-ọjọ). "
"Ṣafikun awoṣe keji ti o gbasilẹ ni oriṣiriṣi ina lati tọju šiši igbẹkẹle ni "
"eyikeyi akoko ti ọjọ."

