#: src/main.ui:610 src/onboarding.ui:707
msgid "Keyring / KWallet Auto-Unlock"
msgstr "Keyring / KWallet Ṣii silẹ laifọwọyi"

#: src/main.ui:624
msgid ""
"Enable face authentication to automatically unlock your login keyring or "
"KWallet on login. This securely stores your password sealed in the TPM when "
"available, or encrypted with AES-256-GCM using a root-only master key. Face "
"auth sets PAM_AUTHTOK for pam_gnome_keyring or pam_kwallet5 depending on "
"your desktop."
msgstr ""
"Mu ijẹrisi oju ṣiṣẹ lati ṣii bọtini iwọle rẹ laifọwọyi tabi KWallet ni "
"wiwole. Eyi tọju ọrọ igbaniwọle rẹ ni aabo ni aabo ni TPM nigba ti o wa, "
"tabi ti paroko pẹlu AES-256-GCM nipa lilo bọtini titunto-root nikan. Awọn "
"iṣeto auth oju PAM_AUTHTOK fun pam_gnome_keyring tabi pam_kwallet5 da lori "
"tabili tabili rẹ."

